      "name": "Adjusted Eyes",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Divers are used to the murky conditions underwater and train for them. If the diver spends 1 hour preparing for their dive, they have low-light vision while underwater.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Diving Specialist",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>For encounters involving underwater exploration, the diver is a 10th-level challenge.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Skilled Diver",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The diver gains a +12 circumstance bonus to any skill check involved in underwater exploration activities and is considered a master in the skill for such checks. This bonus also applies to any initiative roll while the driver is underwater.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Strong Lungs",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The diver can hold their breath for up to 5 minutes (50 rounds).</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Underwater Fighter",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The diver isn't Off-Guard underwater and doesn't take penalties for using a bludgeoning or slashing melee weapon in water.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
